<title>UK: National Grid finance director leaves.</title>
<headline>National Grid finance director leaves.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Grid Group Plc said on Friday that finance director John Uttley was leaving the company by mutual agreement.  </p>
<p>The electricity transmission company said in a statement that Stephen Box, a corporate finance partner at Coopers &amp; Lybrand, will become finance director on August 4.</p>
<p>Chief executive David Jones will take over as acting finance director in the interim.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
